# github.com/grafana/tempo has no /v2 module path, so every commit Grafana can depend on is a
# v1.5.1-0.<date> pseudo-version, which Trivy compares against the fixed 2.x releases.
# Grafana only links tempo's protobuf types (pkg/tempopb) and TraceQL parser (pkg/traceql);
# both CVEs are in the Tempo server (query frontend, status endpoint), which is not compiled in.
CVE-2026-21728
CVE-2026-28377
